PROJECT LICENSE
================

This repository contains:

  1. ORIGINAL EDITORIAL WORK by the project compiler (notes, apparatus,
     introductions, study aids, navigation structure, ONIX metadata, code).

  2. PUBLIC-DOMAIN SOURCES (translation, lexicons, cross-references) which
     remain in the public domain and carry no copyright restriction beyond
     attribution. See COPYRIGHT.md for source-by-source provenance.

