────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
LICENCE FOR PUBLIC-DOMAIN SOURCES
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

The translation, lexicons, and cross-reference apparatus incorporated
in this work are in the public domain in the United States and most
jurisdictions worldwide. Specific provenance:

  - World English Bible (WEB) — Public Domain. Released by Rainbow
    Missions, Inc. with explicit dedication to the public domain.
  - Strong's Exhaustive Concordance of the Bible (Hebrew portion) —
    James Strong, 1890. Public domain by age (>95 years since author's
    death).
  - Treasury of Scripture Knowledge — R. A. Torrey, 1834. Public domain
    by age.

These sources may be freely incorporated into derivative works without
permission. See COPYRIGHT.md for full attribution stack.

